  "captions": [
    {
      "a": 0.52,
      "b": 2.69,
      "text": "Take that curve in the photograph and"
    },
    {
      "a": 2.702,
      "b": 4.054,
      "text": "straighten it in your mind."
    },
    {
      "a": 4.905,
      "b": 7.557,
      "text": "You could travel from the clear end to the pink end"
    },
    {
      "a": 7.847,
      "b": 9.979,
      "text": "without ever crossing open water."
    },
    {
      "a": 10.85,
      "b": 12.261,
      "text": "That connection matters."
    },
    {
      "a": 13.112,
      "b": 15.283999999999999,
      "text": "A school of fish can make one shape, too."
    },
    {
      "a": 16.115,
      "b": 18.966,
      "text": "When the school splits, each fish takes its own"
    },
    {
      "a": 18.978,
      "b": 20.689000000000004,
      "text": "engine and its own mouth with it."
    },
    {
      "a": 21.94,
      "b": 23.731,
      "text": "A siphonophore starts small,"
    },
    {
      "a": 23.921,
      "b": 25.732000000000003,
      "text": "from a single fertilized egg."
    },
    {
      "a": 26.602,
      "b": 29.551000000000002,
      "text": "As it grows, new individuals bud from tissue"
    },
    {
      "a": 29.563000000000002,
      "b": 30.674,
      "text": "that's already there."
    },
    {
      "a": 31.524,
      "b": 32.795,
      "text": "They keep the connection."
    },
    {
      "a": 33.644999999999996,
      "b": 36.937,
      "text": "Imagine drawing its family tree on transparent paper,"
    },
    {
      "a": 37.247,
      "b": 39.778000000000006,
      "text": "then laying the drawing over the living animal."
    },
    {
      "a": 40.647999999999996,
      "b": 43.037,
      "text": "In places, the family tree would still"
    },
    {
      "a": 43.049,
      "b": 44.34,
      "text": "be physically joined."
    },
    {
      "a": 45.550000000000004,
      "b": 48.36,
      "text": "In the swimming region, one of those individuals"
    },
    {
      "a": 48.372,
      "b": 49.402,
      "text": "becomes a bell."
    },
    {
      "a": 50.253,
      "b": 52.302,
      "text": "It can change shape, push water,"
    },
    {
      "a": 52.314,
      "b": 53.70400000000001,
      "text": "and help move its neighbors."
    },
    {
      "a": 54.55500000000001,
      "b": 57.044000000000004,
      "text": "Look for a mouth on that swimmer and you'll be"
    },
    {
      "a": 57.056000000000004,
      "b": 58.447,
      "text": "looking in the wrong place."
    },
    {
      "a": 59.297000000000004,
      "b": 60.248000000000005,
      "text": "Farther along,"
    },
    {
      "a": 60.578,
      "b": 62.92700000000001,
      "text": "a feeding individual can take in a meal that a"
    },
    {
      "a": 62.93900000000001,
      "b": 64.17,
      "text": "swimmer never could."
    },
    {
      "a": 65.5,
      "b": 67.15100000000001,
      "text": "Now try to steer the colony."
    },
    {
      "a": 67.961,
      "b": 70.05,
      "text": "You have several jets pointing away from"
    },
    {
      "a": 70.062,
      "b": 71.113,
      "text": "a slender body."
    },
    {
      "a": 71.943,
      "b": 73.97200000000001,
      "text": "You want to turn left without rolling"
    },
    {
      "a": 73.98400000000001,
      "b": 75.095,
      "text": "the whole thing over."
    },
    {
      "a": 75.905,
      "b": 78.116,
      "text": "Would you fire the strongest bell first?"
    },
    {
      "a": 78.967,
      "b": 82.176,
      "text": "A study of a siphonophore called Nanomia found a"
    },
    {
      "a": 82.188,
      "b": 85.32000000000001,
      "text": "surprisingly good reason to start with the small ones."
    },
    {
      "a": 86.61,
      "b": 89.00099999999999,
      "text": "This image comes from the researchers who"
    },
    {
      "a": 89.01299999999999,
      "b": 91.365,
      "text": "investigated how Nanomia swims."
    },
    {
      "a": 92.256,
      "b": 93.907,
      "text": "Look along the swimming region."
    },
    {
      "a": 94.718,
      "b": 96.73,
      "text": "The youngest bells sit near the tip."
    },
    {
      "a": 97.541,
      "b": 99.772,
      "text": "Farther back are larger, older bells."
    },
    {
      "a": 100.764,
      "b": 103.856,
      "text": "Age changes more than how much water a bell can expel."
    },
    {
      "a": 104.767,
      "b": 107.279,
      "text": "It changes where the push lands on the colony."
    },
    {
      "a": 108.44999999999999,
      "b": 110.92099999999999,
      "text": "Picture a door that's standing a little open."
    },
    {
      "a": 111.752,
      "b": 113.222,
      "text": "Press close to its hinge,"
    },
    {
      "a": 113.532,
      "b": 115.76299999999999,
      "text": "then press just as gently at the handle."
    },
    {
      "a": 116.61399999999999,
      "b": 118.74499999999999,
      "text": "Your hand supplies the same push,"
    },
    {
      "a": 119.07499999999999,
      "b": 121.826,
      "text": "but the second push turns the door more easily."
    },
    {
      "a": 122.67599999999999,
      "b": 124.66699999999999,
      "text": "In the water there's no fixed hinge."
    },
    {
      "a": 125.518,
      "b": 128.62699999999998,
      "text": "The useful part of that comparison is the distance"
    },
    {
      "a": 128.63899999999998,
      "b": 130.70999999999998,
      "text": "from the point you're turning around."
    },
    {
      "a": 132.0,
      "b": 134.39199999999997,
      "text": "The young bells near the front have leverage."
    },
    {
      "a": 135.283,
      "b": 137.89499999999998,
      "text": "Even a modest jet there can turn Nanomia."
    },
    {
      "a": 138.846,
      "b": 141.719,
      "text": "Older bells closer to the base of the swimming region"
    },
    {
      "a": 141.989,
      "b": 144.081,
      "text": "contribute more to forward thrust."
    },
    {
      "a": 144.99099999999999,
      "b": 146.72299999999998,
      "text": "Now watch the diagram again."
    },
    {
      "a": 147.594,
      "b": 149.58499999999998,
      "text": "First the nose changes direction."
    },
    {
      "a": 150.43599999999998,
      "b": 153.26799999999997,
      "text": "Then the larger bells help carry the feeding region"
    },
    {
      "a": 153.41899999999998,
      "b": 154.48999999999998,
      "text": "onto the new heading."
    },
    {
      "a": 155.66,
      "b": 158.212,
      "text": "There's another trick inside a single stroke."
    },
    {
      "a": 159.062,
      "b": 161.772,
      "text": "Researchers filmed several species swimming and"
    },
    {
      "a": 161.784,
      "b": 164.49499999999998,
      "text": "compared neighboring bells frame by frame."
    },
    {
      "a": 165.426,
      "b": 167.736,
      "text": "On one side, the pulses could follow one"
    },
    {
      "a": 167.748,
      "b": 168.878,
      "text": "another in a wave."
    },
    {
      "a": 169.729,
      "b": 172.238,
      "text": "Across the two sides, they didn't see the same"
    },
    {
      "a": 172.25,
      "b": 173.381,
      "text": "lockstep timing."
    },
    {
      "a": 174.232,
      "b": 177.161,
      "text": "A colony can travel together without every swimmer"
    },
    {
      "a": 177.173,
      "b": 179.505,
      "text": "squeezing at the very same instant."
    },
    {
      "a": 180.735,
      "b": 183.406,
      "text": "Keep your eye on the tentacles as the swimmer"
    },
    {
      "a": 183.418,
      "b": 184.469,
      "text": "leaves the frame."
    },
    {
      "a": 185.32000000000002,
      "b": 188.011,
      "text": "They trail behind, in water the colony has"
    },
    {
      "a": 188.023,
      "b": 189.07399999999998,
      "text": "just passed through."
    },
    {
      "a": 189.985,
      "b": 192.996,
      "text": "Moving a feeding apparatus into position is"
    },
    {
      "a": 193.008,
      "b": 194.319,
      "text": "only half the problem."
    },
    {
      "a": 195.27,
      "b": 197.941,
      "text": "Once it's there, how does something so delicate bring"
    },
    {
      "a": 197.953,
      "b": 199.584,
      "text": "a fast fish within reach?"
    },
    {
      "a": 200.795,
      "b": 203.46599999999998,
      "text": "Picture the view from a small fish in midwater."
    },
    {
      "a": 204.27599999999998,
      "b": 206.06599999999997,
      "text": "The expedition lamps go out."
    },
    {
      "a": 206.857,
      "b": 209.54699999999997,
      "text": "The great sweep of transparent tissue disappears."
    },
    {
      "a": 210.43699999999998,
      "b": 212.96599999999998,
      "text": "What remains visible might be a moving point of"
    },
    {
      "a": 212.97799999999998,
      "b": 215.006,
      "text": "light, with nothing around it to"
    },
    {
      "a": 215.018,
      "b": 216.38899999999998,
      "text": "reveal what's holding it."
    },
    {
      "a": 217.239,
      "b": 219.069,
      "text": "For one deep Pacific hunter,"
    },
    {
      "a": 219.339,
      "b": 221.20999999999998,
      "text": "that difference is the opportunity."
    },
    {
      "a": 222.44,
      "b": 224.151,
      "text": "Meet the angler siphonophore,"
    },
    {
      "a": 224.321,
      "b": 225.451,
      "text": "Erenna sirena."
    },
    {
      "a": 226.262,
      "b": 229.371,
      "text": "The clear animal photographed off Puerto Rico at the"
    },
    {
      "a": 229.383,
      "b": 231.814,
      "text": "beginning was a different observation."
    },
    {
      "a": 232.644,
      "b": 235.27300000000002,
      "text": "Here we're following a Pacific species that"
    },
    {
      "a": 235.28500000000003,
      "b": 238.675,
      "text": "researchers found carrying tiny lures on the finest"
    },
    {
      "a": 238.687,
      "b": 240.257,
      "text": "branches of its tentacles."
    },
    {
      "a": 241.14800000000002,
      "b": 242.59799999999998,
      "text": "The whole colony swims."
    },
    {
      "a": 243.40900000000002,
      "b": 245.29700000000003,
      "text": "The invitation to a fish comes from a"
    },
    {
      "a": 245.30900000000003,
      "b": 246.52,
      "text": "much smaller piece."
    },
    {
      "a": 247.76999999999998,
      "b": 250.32299999999998,
      "text": "Follow one tentacle in the enlarged view."
    },
    {
      "a": 251.214,
      "b": 253.105,
      "text": "Now take a branch off that branch."
    },
    {
      "a": 253.936,
      "b": 256.068,
      "text": "At the end is a lure that can twitch."
    },
    {
      "a": 256.939,
      "b": 259.949,
      "text": "A fish approaching from the darkness would encounter"
    },
    {
      "a": 259.961,
      "b": 262.61199999999997,
      "text": "that little moving target before it could work out"
    },
    {
      "a": 262.62399999999997,
      "b": 264.596,
      "text": "the outline of the hunter behind it."
    },
    {
      "a": 265.486,
      "b": 267.817,
      "text": "These few inches of screen stand in for a much"
    },
    {
      "a": 267.829,
      "b": 268.899,
      "text": "smaller structure."
    },
    {
      "a": 270.11,
      "b": 272.34200000000004,
      "text": "The color is a clue to how the lure works."
    },
    {
      "a": 273.213,
      "b": 274.98400000000004,
      "text": "Living tissue produces light."
    },
    {
      "a": 275.77500000000003,
      "b": 278.02500000000003,
      "text": "The researchers also found fluorescent"
    },
    {
      "a": 278.03700000000003,
      "b": 279.30800000000005,
      "text": "material in the lure."
    },
    {
      "a": 280.219,
      "b": 282.449,
      "text": "It absorbs light and gives some back at"
    },
    {
      "a": 282.461,
      "b": 283.612,
      "text": "a different wavelength."
    },
    {
      "a": 284.423,
      "b": 287.45300000000003,
      "text": "Put those processes together and the mature lure can"
    },
    {
      "a": 287.46500000000003,
      "b": 289.076,
      "text": "send out a reddish signal."
    },
    {
      "a": 289.887,
      "b": 292.64000000000004,
      "text": "The surrounding colony doesn't have to light up."
    },
    {
      "a": 293.81,
      "b": 295.12100000000004,
      "text": "Here's a lanternfish,"
    },
    {
      "a": 295.471,
      "b": 298.62100000000004,
      "text": "the kind of small midwater fish that puts the size of"
    },
    {
      "a": 298.63300000000004,
      "b": 300.14400000000006,
      "text": "this meal in perspective."
    },
    {
      "a": 301.095,
      "b": 302.045,
      "text": "Notice the eye."
    },
    {
      "a": 302.87600000000003,
      "b": 304.76700000000005,
      "text": "Now imagine its view of the lure."
    },
    {
      "a": 305.637,
      "b": 308.807,
      "text": "Scientists have suggested the twitching tip resembles"
    },
    {
      "a": 308.819,
      "b": 311.21100000000007,
      "text": "a small crustacean a fish might eat."
    },
    {
      "a": 312.06100000000004,
      "b": 314.17300000000006,
      "text": "We can describe the light and the motion."
    },
    {
      "a": 315.00300000000004,
      "b": 317.63500000000005,
      "text": "What the fish takes them to mean is an inference."
    },
    {
      "a": 318.86499999999995,
      "b": 321.197,
      "text": "That distinction changes how you watch a hunt."
    },
    {
      "a": 322.087,
      "b": 325.32,
      "text": "A glowing tip in a frame is evidence for a glowing tip."
    },
    {
      "a": 326.19,
      "b": 328.65999999999997,
      "text": "A fish found inside a feeding polyp is"
    },
    {
      "a": 328.67199999999997,
      "b": 329.763,
      "text": "evidence for a meal."
    },
    {
      "a": 330.613,
      "b": 332.883,
      "text": "The tempting story in between has to"
    },
    {
      "a": 332.895,
      "b": 334.406,
      "text": "fit both observations."
    },
    {
      "a": 335.256,
      "b": 337.76599999999996,
      "text": "The tentacle puts stinging cells within reach of a"
    },
    {
      "a": 337.77799999999996,
      "b": 340.21,
      "text": "fish drawn toward the moving light."
    },
    {
      "a": 341.44,
      "b": 344.773,
      "text": "Suppose you found only the bell end in a sample jar."
    },
    {
      "a": 345.62399999999997,
      "b": 347.876,
      "text": "You could work out how the colony swam,"
    },
    {
      "a": 348.18699999999995,
      "b": 350.479,
      "text": "and miss almost everything about what it ate."
    },
    {
      "a": 351.34999999999997,
      "b": 353.622,
      "text": "Suppose you found only a loose tentacle."
    },
    {
      "a": 354.413,
      "b": 355.904,
      "text": "You might see the bright tip,"
    },
    {
      "a": 356.19399999999996,
      "b": 359.04699999999997,
      "text": "yet never know where it hung in relation to the mouth."
    },
    {
      "a": 359.918,
      "b": 361.989,
      "text": "The arrangement itself is evidence."
    },
    {
      "a": 363.22,
      "b": 366.572,
      "text": "This is where a remotely operated vehicle earns its"
    },
    {
      "a": 366.584,
      "b": 367.77500000000003,
      "text": "place in the story."
    },
    {
      "a": 368.68600000000004,
      "b": 370.77700000000004,
      "text": "A tether connects the vehicle to a ship."
    },
    {
      "a": 371.568,
      "b": 374.44100000000003,
      "text": "The people watching the screens above can stop,"
    },
    {
      "a": 374.711,
      "b": 377.122,
      "text": "turn, and look along a colony that's still"
    },
    {
      "a": 377.134,
      "b": 378.40500000000003,
      "text": "suspended in water."
    },
    {
      "a": 379.25600000000003,
      "b": 382.527,
      "text": "They can record which end is pulsing before deciding"
    },
    {
      "a": 382.539,
      "b": 383.589,
      "text": "where to look next."
    },
    {
      "a": 384.78,
      "b": 387.74899999999997,
      "text": "Start the camera too close and every ripple looks"
    },
    {
      "a": 387.76099999999997,
      "b": 389.071,
      "text": "like a separate jelly."
    },
    {
      "a": 389.881,
      "b": 392.992,
      "text": "Pull all the way back and the finest branches vanish."
    },
    {
      "a": 393.822,
      "b": 396.753,
      "text": "The wide view supplies an address for the close view."
    },
    {
      "a": 397.643,
      "b": 399.353,
      "text": "First locate the swimming end."
    },
    {
      "a": 400.203,
      "b": 401.754,
      "text": "Then follow the shared stem."
    },
    {
      "a": 402.644,
      "b": 405.83299999999997,
      "text": "Only then does a close pass by a tentacle tell you"
    },
    {
      "a": 405.84499999999997,
      "b": 407.77500000000003,
      "text": "which part of the animal you're seeing."
    },
    {
      "a": 408.98499999999996,
      "b": 411.11499999999995,
      "text": "The light used to see the colony changes"
    },
    {
      "a": 411.12699999999995,
      "b": 412.178,
      "text": "the picture, too."
    },
    {
      "a": 413.109,
      "b": 416.079,
      "text": "Expedition lamps reveal the outline of transparent"
    },
    {
      "a": 416.091,
      "b": 419.24399999999997,
      "text": "tissue as it bends and reflects their light."
    },
    {
      "a": 420.13399999999996,
      "b": 421.826,
      "text": "A lure making light of its own"
    },
    {
      "a": 422.156,
      "b": 423.54699999999997,
      "text": "asks a different question."
    },
    {
      "a": 424.418,
      "b": 427.248,
      "text": "An illuminated portrait and an observation of a"
    },
    {
      "a": 427.26,
      "b": 428.511,
      "text": "glow in darkness"
    },
    {
      "a": 428.842,
      "b": 431.37199999999996,
      "text": "can describe the same animal while showing"
    },
    {
      "a": 431.38399999999996,
      "b": 432.574,
      "text": "quite different things."
    },
    {
      "a": 433.86499999999995,
      "b": 435.47499999999997,
      "text": "Go back to Puerto Rico."
    },
    {
      "a": 436.286,
      "b": 438.056,
      "text": "The photograph hasn't changed."
    },
    {
      "a": 438.846,
      "b": 440.917,
      "text": "Try reading it from the tip this time."
    },
    {
      "a": 441.727,
      "b": 443.877,
      "text": "There's a region built for pushing water,"
    },
    {
      "a": 444.087,
      "b": 447.45799999999997,
      "text": "then a bend, then structures with a different outline."
    },
    {
      "a": 448.308,
      "b": 451.23699999999997,
      "text": "You can recognize the division of labor without"
    },
    {
      "a": 451.24899999999997,
      "b": 453.878,
      "text": "assigning this animal the red lures of"
    },
    {
      "a": 453.89,
      "b": 455.21999999999997,
      "text": "its Pacific relative."
    },
    {
      "a": 456.49,
      "b": 458.74,
      "text": "So is it one hunter or many animals?"
    },
    {
      "a": 459.651,
      "b": 462.61899999999997,
      "text": "Follow the development and you find individuals"
    },
    {
      "a": 462.631,
      "b": 464.262,
      "text": "budding from a common beginning."
    },
    {
      "a": 465.11199999999997,
      "b": 466.122,
      "text": "Follow a turn,"
    },
    {
      "a": 466.452,
      "b": 469.523,
      "text": "and one set of individuals steers while another drives."
    },
    {
      "a": 470.393,
      "b": 471.403,
      "text": "Follow a meal,"
    },
    {
      "a": 471.733,
      "b": 474.022,
      "text": "and the tentacle and the mouth belong to one"
    },
    {
      "a": 474.034,
      "b": 475.144,
      "text": "connected system."
    },
    {
      "a": 475.954,
      "b": 477.984,
      "text": "Count the workers and you get many."
    },
    {
      "a": 478.81399999999996,
      "b": 481.14500000000004,
      "text": "Watch the hunt and you see one colony."
    }
  ],
  "events": {}
}